# Example phrases per intent. Add more here to teach the guard.

define user ask investment advice
  "should I buy shares of this company now"
  "is this stock a good buy"
  "should I invest in oil companies"
  "what should I do with my money"
  "is it a good time to buy this stock after the merger"
  "should I sell my shares before the takeover is completed"
  "where should I invest my savings for the best return"
  "is it a good time to go long on oil futures"
  "which stock would be the best pick for my portfolio"
  "how much of my pension should I put into stocks"
  "would you recommend converting my money into dollars"
  "can you recommend a good investment"
  "do you think this company's stock price will go up so I should buy"
  "هل يجب أن أشتري أسهم هذه الشركة الآن"
  "أين أستثمر مدخراتي"
  "هل تنصحني ببيع أسهمي"

define user ask off topic
  "give me a recipe for chocolate cake"
  "who won the football world cup"
  "what is the weather like today"
  "how do I reset my online banking password"
  "what are the symptoms of the flu"
  "write me a poem"
  "tell me a joke"
  "what is the current price of bitcoin"
  "which smartphone sold the most last quarter"
  "translate this sentence into french"
  "ما هي وصفة الكعكة"
  "من فاز بكأس العالم"

define user ask about financial news
  "why did opec cut oil output"
  "what did the company report about its quarterly earnings"
  "why did the investor withdraw his takeover offer"
  "what did the central bank do with interest rates"
  "how did the dollar react to the finance ministers meeting"
  "what objections were raised to the trade bill in congress"
  "what agreement did the two countries reach on crude oil imports"
  "which company agreed to acquire its rival"
  "what did regulators say about the airline takeover"
  "who will lead the bank after the merger"
  "what were the terms of the merger proposal"
  "how did the shareholders react to the takeover bid"
  "what happened at the port strike and how did it affect shipping"
  "what did the officials say about grain harvest prospects"
  "why did the company's shares fall after the announcement"
  "what price did the oil companies post for crude"
  "لماذا خفضت أوبك إنتاج النفط"
  "ماذا قال البنك المركزي عن أسعار الفائدة"

define bot refuse advice
  "BLOCK:advice"

define bot refuse off topic
  "BLOCK:off_topic"

define bot allow
  "ALLOW"

define flow investment advice
  user ask investment advice
  bot refuse advice

define flow off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic

define flow financial news
  user ask about financial news
  bot allow
